  "content": "<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://ipn.anti-ad.org/assets/static/Inventory_Profiles_Next_Bg1line.png\" width=\"800px\"></p>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;text-align:center\"><a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://discord.gg/23YCxmveUM\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/861171785897738240?style=plastic&amp;logo=discord&amp;label=discord&amp;link=https://discord.gg/23YCxmveUM\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/495267?style=plastic&amp;logo=curseforge\" alt=\"CurseForge 下载量\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/inventory-profiles-next?style=plastic&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;link=https://modrinth.com/mod/inventory-profiles-next\" alt=\"Modrinth 下载量\"> <a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://github.com/blackd/Inventory-Profiles\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/source-code-blue?style=plastic&amp;logo=github\" alt=\"静态徽章\"></a></p>\n</div><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px\">该模组将：</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-size:14px\">帮助你整理背包</li>\n<li style=\"font-size:14px\">替换你快要损坏的工具</li>\n<li style=\"font-size:14px\">一键将物品放入箱子</li>\n<li style=\"font-size:14px\">把你已有的物品连同箱子内的同类物品一并移动</li>\n<li style=\"font-size:14px\">锁定物品槽位，使排序时忽略它们</li>\n<li style=\"font-size:14px\">保持锁定槽位为空</li>\n<li style=\"font-size:14px\">允许你按 R+C 设置快捷键</li>\n<li style=\"font-size:14px\">纯客户端运行，因此随处可用</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://discord.gg/23YCxmveUM\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入我们的 Discord 服务器</a></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/blackd/Inventory-Profiles/all-in-one/description/output.webp\" width=\"300px\"></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px\">该模组 <strong style=\"font-size:14px\">并非</strong> Inventory Tweaks 的替代品</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-size:14px\">无法让 Inventory Profiles Next 像 Inventory Tweaks 一样工作</li>\n<li style=\"font-size:14px\">如果你来自 Inventory Tweaks，你需要学习如何使用 Inventory Profiles Next</li>\n<li style=\"font-size:14px\">如果无法适应，你可以使用 <a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/invtweaks-emu-for-ipn\" rel=\"nofollow\">InvTweaks Emu for IPN</a> 来模拟部分 Inventory Tweaks 的快捷键功能。</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:bold\">喜欢这个模组？请考虑请我喝杯咖啡。</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-weight:bold\">成为 Patreon 赞助者</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"background-color:dimgray\"><a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mirinimi\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://ipn.anti-ad.org/cgi-bin/test.png\" alt=\"Patreon 标志\"> </a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"font-weight:bold\">成为 GitHub 赞助者</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</td>\n<td><span><iframe src=\"https://github.com/sponsors/blackd/button\" height=\"35\" width=\"142\"></iframe></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"font-weight:bold\">使用教程</h2><p>&nbsp;</p><div style=\"width:100%\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/cv7_vW-GIJU?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></div><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"font-weight:bold\">依赖项</h2><p>&nbsp;</p><h3 style=\"font-weight:bold\">Fabric</h3><p>&nbsp;</p><ul>\n<li style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a></li>\n<li style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-language-kotlin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric Language Kotlin</a></li>\n<li style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/libipn\" rel=\"nofollow\">libIPN</a></li>\n<li style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu</a></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h3 style=\"font-weight:bold\">Forge</h3><p>&nbsp;</p><ul>\n<li style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kotlin-for-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Kotlin for Forge</a></li>\n<li style=\"font-size:14px\"><a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/libipn\" rel=\"nofollow\">libIPN</a></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"font-weight:bold\">警告</h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"font-size:14px\">由于多次 Quilt 专属崩溃和一次物品复制问题，Quilt 的支持现定义如下：</p><pre><code>该模组将通过提供的 Fabric 兼容性在 Quilt 上运行。\n任何无法在 Fabric 上重现的问题将以非常低的优先级处理。</code></pre><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"font-weight:bold\">贡献</h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"font-size:14px\">如果出现问题，请在此处<a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://github.com/blackd/Inventory-Profiles/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">提交问题</a></p><p style=\"font-size:14px\">如果你使用其他语言并希望帮助翻译，可以在此处<a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://github.com/blackd/Inventory-Profiles/tree/all-in-one/common/src/main/resources/assets/inventoryprofilesnext/lang\" rel=\"nofollow\">参与翻译</a></p><p style=\"font-size:14px\">如果你是 Kotlin 开发者并希望贡献代码，请查看<a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://github.com/blackd/Inventory-Profiles\" rel=\"nofollow\">源代码</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"font-weight:bold\">许可证</h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"font-size:14px\">该模组基于 <a style=\"font-size:14px\" href=\"https://github.com/blackd/Inventory-Profiles/blob/all-in-one/LICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow\">AGPL v3 许可证</a> 发布</p><p style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</p>",
